{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/extras/d8e41466e08648d2f9dfc18449e3c1cd.webp?t=1760658810\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/extras/d8e41466e08648d2f9dfc18449e3c1cd.poster.avif?t=1760658810\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=220 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neighborhood Video</strong> is part 90s video rental store simulator, part escape room, all totally radical. In between stocking popcorn, rewinding VHS tapes and mopping floors, you\u2019ll be tasked with decoding the instructions to lock up every night - and if you look closely, you may find a deeper conspiracy behind the barcodes. Scour the video rental database to hunt down broken and missing selections from the library, but keep your mitts off the merchandise; Mr. Manager runs a tight ship and won\u2019t let you leave until all his films are nestled on the shelves. So clip on that name tag, holster those 3D glasses, and don\u2019t forget Neighborhood Video mascot Seymour Moovies\u2019 iconic slogan:\u00a0MOO-ve over, Blockbuster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/extras/932c25497396e0201e8525ee9ba9c407.avif?t=1760658810\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully stocked video rental store, straight out of the 90\u2019s!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-Y2K clunky PC technology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lite vandalism</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large variety of refreshments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute cow mascot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysteries abound!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/extras/674682372b34f56652b037f32edf83dc.avif?t=1760658810\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the newest employee at Neighborhood Video, don your name tag and get to work rewinding and returning tapes, cleaning up the aisles, and keeping your eyes peeled for anything out of place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/extras/ee64330473495274f81326a4d32b95a2.avif?t=1760658810\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only will you keep the store in order, you\u2019ll also find yourself deep in the Neighborhood Video POS Computer terminal. Explore customers\u2019 rental history, dig up data about certain films, and maybe uncover an anomaly or two, who knows!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072630?t=1760658810","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/1f09f1973dcaa2578ed90a1257701446faddc3b1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760658810","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/fa37be80d3d8c38b67f140057c459313d308799f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760658810","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/fa37be80d3d8c38b67f140057c459313d308799f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760658810","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"descriptio